msgstr ""
"X-Qt-Contexts: true\n"
"X-Language: zh_Hant\n"
"X-Source-Language: American English\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: zh_Hant\n"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Survival"
msgstr "生存分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Perform analyses of censored time to event data."
msgstr "對刪失的至事件發生的時間資料進行生存分析。"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Classical"
msgstr "經典"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Non-parametric"
msgstr "非引數"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Non-parametric Survival Analysis"
msgstr "非引數生存分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Semi-parametric"
msgstr "半引數"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Semi-parametric Survival Analysis"
msgstr "半引數生存分析"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Parametric"
msgstr "引數"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Parametric Survival Analysis"
msgstr "引數生存分析"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr "至事件發生時間"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring"
"occurs."
msgstr "選擇代表直到事件發生或刪失發生的時間的變數。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr "事件狀態"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each"
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr "選擇表示事件狀態的變數，指明每個觀測是事件還是刪失。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr "事件指示值"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence"
"of the event."
msgstr "指定“事件狀態”變數中表示事件發生的值。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Strata"
msgstr "分層"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select variables to define strata, allowing separate survival curves for each"
"stratum."
msgstr "選擇變數以定義分層，允許為每個分層分別繪製生存曲線。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "權重"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly in"
"the model."
msgstr "選擇用於案例權重的變數，據此在模型中為每個觀測加權。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr "刪失摘要"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the"
"data."
msgstr "建立包含資料刪失狀態資訊的摘要表。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "檢驗"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Peto and Peto"
msgstr "Peto和Peto"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Peto and Peto modification of the Gehan-Wilcoxon test to compare"
"survival curves across strata."
msgstr "包含Peto和Peto對Gehan-Wilcoxon檢驗的改進，以比較不同分層的生存曲線。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Flemming-Harrington"
msgstr "Flemming-Harrington"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Fleming-Harrington test to compare survival curves across strata.,"
"with a customizable rho parameter."
msgstr "包含Fleming-Harrington檢驗以比較不同分層的生存曲線，並帶有可自定義的rho引數。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rho"
msgstr "Rho"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Life table"
msgstr "壽命表"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generate a life table summarizing survival data at specified time intervals."
msgstr "生成一個在指定時間區間內彙總生存資料的壽命表。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Steps type"
msgstr "步長型別"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the method to define intervals for the life table: Default, Quantiles,"
"or Fixed size."
msgstr "選擇定義壽命表區間的方法：預設、分位數或固定大小。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Default"
msgstr "預設"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Quantilies"
msgstr "分位數"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fixed size"
msgstr "固定大小"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Number"
msgstr "數量"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Specify the number of intervals when using Quantiles as the steps type."
msgstr "當使用分位數作為步長型別時，指定區間的數量。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Round steps"
msgstr "取整步長"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Round the interval boundaries to the nearest integer when using Quantiles"
"steps."
msgstr "當使用分位數步長時，將區間邊界取整到最接近的整數。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "From"
msgstr "從"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the starting time for intervals when using Fixed size steps."
msgstr "當使用固定大小步長時，設定區間的起始時間。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Define the size of each interval when using Fixed size steps."
msgstr "當使用固定大小步長時，定義每個區間的大小。"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "To"
msgstr "到"

msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the ending time for intervals when using Fixed size steps."
msgstr "當使用固定大小步長時，設定區間的結束時間。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "This analysis performs a parametric survival analysis."
msgstr "此分析執行引數生存分析。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval Start"
msgstr "區間開始"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the start time of the observation"
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Interval or Counting."
msgstr "選擇代表觀測區間開始時間的變數。僅當“刪失型別”設定為“區間”或“計數”時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval End"
msgstr "區間結束"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the end time of the observation interval."
"Only available when Censoring Type is set to Interval or Counting."
msgstr "選擇代表觀測區間結束時間的變數。僅當“刪失型別”設定為“區間”或“計數”時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr "至事件發生時間"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring"
"occurs. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Right or Counting."
msgstr "選擇代表直到事件發生或刪失發生的時間的變數。僅當“刪失型別”設定為“右”或“計數”時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr "事件狀態"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each"
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr "選擇表示事件狀態的變數，指明每個觀測是事件還是刪失。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr "事件指示值"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence"
"of the event."
msgstr "指定“事件狀態”變數中表示事件發生的值。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "協變數"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add continuous variables as covariates to include them in the Cox regression"
"model."
msgstr "新增連續變數作為協變數，以將其納入Cox迴歸模型。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "因子"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add categorical variables as factors to include them in the Cox regression"
"model."
msgstr "新增分類變數作為因子，以將其納入Cox迴歸模型。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "權重"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly in"
"the model."
msgstr "選擇用於案例權重的變數，據此在模型中為每個觀測加權。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "亞組"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for subgroup analysis, allowing for separate analyses within"
"each subgroup."
msgstr "選擇用於亞組分析的變數，允許在每個亞組內進行單獨分析。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring Type"
msgstr "刪失型別"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Select the type of censoring in your data: right, left, or interval censoring."
msgstr "選擇資料中的刪失型別：右刪失、左刪失或區間刪失。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Counting"
msgstr "計數"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval"
msgstr "區間"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr "刪失摘要"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the"
"data."
msgstr "建立包含資料刪失狀態資訊的摘要表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "分佈"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the parametric distribution for the analysis. All fits and display"
"results for all 'Selected parametric families' in the 'Advanced' section."
"'Best AIC' and 'Best BIC' fit all `Selected parametric families` in the"
"Advanced section and display the results only for a parametric family with the"
"lowest AIC/BIC."
msgstr ""
"選擇分析的引數分佈。“全部”擬合“高階”部分的所有“已選引數族”並顯示其結果。"
"“最佳AIC”和“最佳BIC”擬合“高階”部分的所有“已選引數族”，且僅顯示AIC/BIC最低的引數族的結果。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Exponential"
msgstr "指數"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gamma"
msgstr "伽馬"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generalized F"
msgstr "廣義F"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generalized gamma"
msgstr "廣義伽馬"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gompertz"
msgstr "Gompertz"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log-logistic"
msgstr "對數邏輯"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log-normal"
msgstr "對數正態"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weibull"
msgstr "Weibull"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "All"
msgstr "全部"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Best AIC"
msgstr "最佳AIC"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Best BIC"
msgstr "最佳BIC"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include intercept"
msgstr "包含截距"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interpret model"
msgstr "解釋模型"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the model to interpret. Defaults to the last specified model."
"Alternatives are 'All' which produces results for all of the specified models"
"or 'Best' which produces results for the best fitting model based on either"
"AIC or BIC. If distribution and model selection is specified simultanously,"
"the best model within the best performing distribution is going to be"
"selected. If model selection is specified while all distributions are"
"selected, the best model within each distribution is going to be selected."
msgstr ""
"選擇要解釋的模型。預設為最後指定的模型。備選方案為“全部”，即生成所有指定模型的結果，"
"或“最佳”，即基於AIC或BIC生成最佳擬合模型的結果。如果同時指定了分佈和模型選擇，則選擇表現最"
"佳的分佈內的最佳模型。如果在選擇所有分佈的同時指定了模型選擇，則選擇每種分佈內的最佳模型。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "統計"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model summary"
msgstr "模型摘要"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with information about the model fit."
msgstr "包含一個帶有模型擬合資訊的表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rank models"
msgstr "對模型排序"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rank models based on the selected criterion."
msgstr "根據所選準則對模型進行排序。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "AIC"
msgstr "AIC"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "BIC"
msgstr "BIC"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log lik."
msgstr "對數似然"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "AIC weights"
msgstr "AIC權重"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include AIC weights in the model summary."
msgstr "在模型摘要中包含AIC權重。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "BIC weights"
msgstr "BIC權重"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include BIC weights in the model summary."
msgstr "在模型摘要中包含BIC權重。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Coefficients"
msgstr "係數"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with coefficient estimates."
msgstr "包含一個帶有係數估計值的表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Confidence intervals"
msgstr "置信區間"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include confidence intervals for the coefficients."
msgstr "包含係數的置信區間。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the confidence level for the confidence intervals."
msgstr "設定置信區間的置信水平。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Coefficients covariance matrix"
msgstr "係數協方差矩陣"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the covariance matrix of the coefficient estimates."
msgstr "包含一個帶有係數估計值協方差矩陣的表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Sequential model comparison"
msgstr "序貫模型比較"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the results of the sequential model comparison."
msgstr "包含一個帶有序貫模型比較結果的表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Predictions"
msgstr "預測"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Survival Time"
msgstr "生存時間"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Table"
msgstr "表格"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the predicted survival estimates."
msgstr "包含一個帶有預測生存估計值的表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plot"
msgstr "圖表"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a plot with the predicted survival estimates."
msgstr "包含一個帶有預測生存估計值的圖。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Steps type"
msgstr "步長型別"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the method to define intervals for the life table: Default, Quantiles,"
"or Custom."
msgstr "選擇定義壽命表區間的方法：預設、分位數或自定義。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Quantilies"
msgstr "分位數"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Sequence"
msgstr "序列"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定義"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Number"
msgstr "數量"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the number of quantiles of the predicted surival when using Quantiles"
"as the steps type."
msgstr "當使用分位數作為步長型別時，指定預測生存的分位數數量。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "From"
msgstr "從"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the starting quantile of the predicted survival when using Sequence steps."
msgstr "當使用序列步長時，設定預測生存的起始分位數。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Define the size of each quantile of the predicted survival when using Sequence"
"steps."
msgstr "當使用序列步長時，定義預測生存的每個分位數的大小。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "To"
msgstr "到"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the ending quantile of the predicted survival when using Sequence steps."
msgstr "當使用序列步長時，設定預測生存的結束分位數。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "步長"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Specify custom steps of the predicted survival."
msgstr "指定預測生存的自定義步長。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Merge plots across distributions"
msgstr "跨分佈合併圖"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the plots for survival probability across distributions into a single"
"plot. Only available when no model selection is being performed."
msgstr "將不同分佈的生存機率圖合併為單個圖。僅當未進行模型選擇時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Options"
msgstr "選項"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include confidence intervals for the figures and tables."
msgstr "為圖形和表格包含置信區間。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Legend"
msgstr "圖例"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the position of the legend on prediction plots with multiple displayed"
"curves."
msgstr "在顯示多條曲線的預測圖中選擇圖例的位置。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "底部"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左側"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Top"
msgstr "頂部"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "無"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Customize the color palette used in prediction plots with multiple displayed"
"curves."
msgstr "自定義在顯示多條曲線的預測圖中使用的調色盤。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主題"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the theme for prediction plots. The detailed theme works only for"
"'Survival probabilities' plots."
msgstr "選擇預測圖的主題。詳細主題僅適用於“生存機率”圖。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "White background"
msgstr "白色背景"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Light"
msgstr "淺色"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Minimal"
msgstr "極簡"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "詳細"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Survival Probability"
msgstr "生存機率"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the predicted survival probabilities."
msgstr "包含一個帶有預測生存機率的表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a plot with the predicted survival probabilities."
msgstr "包含一個帶有預測生存機率的圖。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Kaplan-Meier"
msgstr "Kaplan-Meier"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a Kaplan-Meier curve in the plot. Only available when Censoring Type is"
"set to Right."
msgstr "在圖中顯示Kaplan-Meier曲線。僅當“刪失型別”設定為“右”時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring events"
msgstr "刪失事件"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show censoring events as rug marks in the plot. Only available when Censoring"
"Type is set to Right."
msgstr "在圖中以地毯標記顯示刪失事件。僅當“刪失型別”設定為“右”時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "X-axis transformation"
msgstr "X軸變換"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Select the transformation for the x-axis of the plot"
msgstr "選擇圖x軸的變換"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Log"
msgstr "對數"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Y-axis transformation"
msgstr "Y軸變換"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Select the transformation for the y-axis of the plot"
msgstr "選擇圖y軸的變換"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "As failure probability"
msgstr "作為失效機率"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Hazard"
msgstr "風險"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the predicted hazard estimates."
msgstr "包含一個帶有預測風險估計值的表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a plot with the predicted hazard estimates."
msgstr "包含一個帶有預測風險估計值的圖。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Cumulative Hazard"
msgstr "累積風險"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the predicted cumulative hazard estimates."
msgstr "包含一個帶有預測累積風險估計值的表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a plot with the predicted cumulative hazard estimates."
msgstr "包含一個帶有預測累積風險估計值的圖。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Restricted Mean Survival Time"
msgstr "受限均值生存時間"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a table with the restricted mean survival time estimates."
msgstr "包含一個帶有受限均值生存時間估計值的表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include a plot with the restricted mean survival time estimates."
msgstr "包含一個帶有受限均值生存時間估計值的圖。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the number of quantiles of the life time when using Quantiles as the"
"steps type."
msgstr "當使用分位數作為步長型別時，指定壽命的分位數數量。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the starting quantile of the life time when using Sequence steps."
msgstr "當使用序列步長時，設定壽命的起始分位數。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Define the size of each quantile of the life time when using Sequence steps."
"The default '' corresponds to 1/10 of the maximum observed time."
msgstr ""
"當使用序列步長時，定義壽命的每個分位數的大小。預設值''對應於最大觀測時間的1/10。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Set the final step of the life time when using Sequence steps. The default ''"
"corresponds to the maximum observed time."
msgstr "當使用序列步長時，設定壽命的最終步長。預設值''對應於最大觀測時間。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Round steps"
msgstr "取整步長"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Round the interval boundaries to the nearest integer when using Quantiles or"
"Sequence steps."
msgstr "當使用分位數或序列步長時，將區間邊界取整到最接近的整數。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Specify custom steps of the life time."
msgstr "指定壽命的自定義步長。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Merge tables across measures"
msgstr "跨度量合併表"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the tables for survival time, survival probabilities, hazard, cumulative"
"hazard, and restricted mean survival time into a single table."
msgstr "將生存時間、生存機率、風險、累積風險和受限均值生存時間的表合併為單個表。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the plots for survival time, survival probabilities, hazard, cumulative"
"hazard, and restricted mean survival across distributions into a single plot."
"Only available when no model selection is being performed."
msgstr ""
"將生存時間、生存機率、風險、累積風險和受限均值生存的跨分佈圖合併為單個圖。"
"僅當未進行模型選擇時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "診斷"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residual Plots"
msgstr "殘差圖"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. time"
msgstr "殘差對時間"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus time. Only available when Censoring Type is set to"
"Right."
msgstr "繪製殘差對時間的圖。僅當“刪失型別”設定為“右”時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predictors"
msgstr "殘差對預測變數"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus predictors to assess model fit. Available when model"
"terms are specified."
msgstr "繪製殘差對預測變數的圖以評估模型擬合。當指定模型項時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predicted survival"
msgstr "殘差對預測生存"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plot residuals versus predicted survival probabilities."
msgstr "繪製殘差對預測生存機率的圖。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals histogram"
msgstr "殘差直方圖"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display a histogram of residuals to assess their distribution."
msgstr "顯示殘差的直方圖以評估其分佈。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "型別"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Select the type of residuals to plot"
msgstr "選擇要繪製的殘差型別"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Response"
msgstr "響應"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Cox-Snell"
msgstr "Cox-Snell"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Probability plot"
msgstr "機率圖"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a model-based probability plot to assess how well the selected"
"parametric distribution describes the observed failure times. Only available"
"when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr ""
"建立基於模型的機率圖，以評估所選引數分佈對觀測失效時間的擬合程度。"
"僅當“刪失型別”設定為“右”時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Canvas"
msgstr "畫布"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the probability-paper scale. A distribution matching the selected"
"canvas appears approximately as a straight line. The exponential canvas uses"
"linear time and cumulative-hazard probability scaling; the other canvases use"
"log time."
msgstr ""
"選擇機率紙刻度。與所選畫布匹配的分佈近似呈一條直線。指數畫布使用線性時間和累積風險機率刻度；"
"其他畫布使用對數時間。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Empirical points"
msgstr "經驗點"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plot empirical failure probability points based on the observed failure times."
msgstr "基於觀測失效時間繪製經驗失效機率點。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Coordinates"
msgstr "座標"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display the time and failure probability next to each empirical point."
msgstr "在每個經驗點旁顯示時間和失效機率。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fitted curve"
msgstr "擬合曲線"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plot the fitted curve from the selected parametric model."
msgstr "繪製所選引數模型的擬合曲線。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show censored observations as rug marks at the bottom of the plot. Only"
"available when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr "在圖的底部以地毯標記顯示刪失觀測。僅當“刪失型別”設定為“右”時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Merge the probability plots across distributions into a single plot. Only"
"available when no model selection is being performed."
msgstr "將不同分佈的機率圖合併為單個圖。僅當未進行模型選擇時可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include confidence interval bounds for the fitted probability curve."
msgstr "為擬合的機率曲線包含置信區間邊界。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the confidence level for the probability plot confidence intervals."
msgstr "設定機率圖置信區間的置信水平。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "網格"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display probability-paper grid lines."
msgstr "顯示機率紙網格線。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plotting position"
msgstr "繪圖位置"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the method used to compute empirical failure probability plotting"
"positions."
msgstr "選擇用於計算經驗失效機率繪圖位置的方法。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Median"
msgstr "中位數"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Benard"
msgstr "Benard"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Hazen"
msgstr "Hazen"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Mean"
msgstr "均值"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Blom"
msgstr "Blom"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rank adjustment"
msgstr "秩調整"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the rank adjustment method for right-censored observations. The Kaplan-"
"Meier adjustment follows the WeibullR/Minitab convention, including the final-"
"failure adjustment used to keep points finite on probability paper."
msgstr ""
"選擇右刪失觀測的秩調整方法。Kaplan-Meier調整遵循WeibullR/Minitab約定，"
"包括用於保持機率紙上點有限的最終失效調整。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Johnson"
msgstr "Johnson"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Ties"
msgstr "結"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select how tied failure times are handled when computing empirical plotting"
"positions."
msgstr "選擇在計算經驗繪圖位置時如何處理並列的失效時間。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Highest"
msgstr "最高"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Lowest"
msgstr "最低"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Sequential"
msgstr "序貫"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Choose the legend position for probability plots with multiple fitted curves."
msgstr "為具有多條擬合曲線的機率圖選擇圖例位置。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Customize the color palette used in probability plots with multiple fitted"
"curves."
msgstr "自定義在具有多條擬合曲線的機率圖中使用的調色盤。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Select the theme for the probability plot's appearance."
msgstr "選擇機率圖外觀的主題。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高階"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Selected Parametric Distributions"
msgstr "已選引數分佈"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Output Formatting"
msgstr "輸出格式"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include full dataset in subgroup analysis"
msgstr "在亞組分析中包含完整資料集"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the full dataset output in the subgroup analysis. This option is only"
"available when the subgroup analysis is selected."
msgstr "在亞組分析中包含完整資料集的輸出。僅當選擇了亞組分析時此選項可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Compare models across distributions"
msgstr "跨分佈比較模型"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Compare models across distributions. This option is only available when the"
"multiple models and parametric distributions are specified."
msgstr "跨分佈比較模型。僅當指定了多個模型和引數分佈時此選項可用。"

msgctxt "ParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Always display model information"
msgstr "始終顯示模型資訊"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval Start"
msgstr "區間開始"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the start time of the observation"
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Counting."
msgstr "選擇代表觀測區間開始時間的變數。僅當“刪失型別”設定為“計數”時可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval End"
msgstr "區間結束"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the end time of the observation interval."
"Only available when Censoring Type is set to Counting."
msgstr "選擇代表觀測區間結束時間的變數。僅當“刪失型別”設定為“計數”時可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr "至事件發生時間"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring"
"occurs. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr "選擇代表直到事件發生或刪失發生的時間的變數。僅當“刪失型別”設定為“右”時可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr "事件狀態"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each"
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr "選擇表示事件狀態的變數，指明每個觀測是事件還是刪失。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr "事件指示值"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence"
"of the event."
msgstr "指定“事件狀態”變數中表示事件發生的值。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "協變數"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add continuous variables as covariates to include them in the Cox regression"
"model."
msgstr "新增連續變數作為協變數，以將其納入Cox迴歸模型。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "因子"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add categorical variables as factors to include them in the Cox regression"
"model."
msgstr "新增分類變數作為因子，以將其納入Cox迴歸模型。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "權重"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly in"
"the model."
msgstr "選擇用於案例權重的變數，據此在模型中為每個觀測加權。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring Type"
msgstr "刪失型別"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the type of censoring in your data: Right censoring or Counting"
"process."
msgstr "選擇資料中的刪失型別：右刪失或計數過程。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Counting"
msgstr "計數"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr "刪失摘要"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the"
"data."
msgstr "建立包含資料刪失狀態資訊的摘要表。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Efron"
msgstr "Efron"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Breslow"
msgstr "Breslow"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Exact"
msgstr "精確"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Choose the method for handling tied event times: Efron, Breslow, or Exact."
msgstr "選擇處理並列事件時間的方法：Efron、Breslow或精確。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Strata, Cluster, and Frailty"
msgstr "分層、聚類與脆弱性"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Strata"
msgstr "分層"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select variables to define strata, allowing separate baseline hazard functions"
"for each stratum."
msgstr "選擇變數以定義分層，允許為每個分層建立單獨的基線風險函式。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Cluster"
msgstr "聚類"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable to define clusters of correlated observations for robust"
"variance estimation. Disabled when a Frailty variable is specified or Method"
"is set to Exact."
msgstr ""
"選擇變數以定義相關觀測的聚類，用於穩健方差估計。當指定脆弱性變數或將方法設定為“精確”時停用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Frailty"
msgstr "脆弱性"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for frailty to model unobserved heterogeneity using random"
"effects. Disabled when a Cluster variable is specified."
msgstr "選擇脆弱性變數以使用隨機效應建模未觀測到的異質性。當指定聚類變數時停用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "分佈"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the distribution for the frailty term: Gamma, Gaussian, or T"
"distribution. Only available when a Frailty variable is specified."
msgstr "選擇脆弱性項的分佈：伽馬、高斯或t分佈。僅當指定了脆弱性變數時可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gamma"
msgstr "伽馬"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Gaussian"
msgstr "高斯"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "T"
msgstr "t"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the estimation method for the frailty distribution. Options vary based"
"on the chosen Distribution."
msgstr "選擇脆弱性分佈的估計方法。選項根據所選的分佈而變化。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "EM"
msgstr "EM"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "AIC"
msgstr "AIC"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fixed"
msgstr "固定"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "REML"
msgstr "REML"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Df"
msgstr "Df"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Fix"
msgstr "固定"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the parameter to fix in the frailty model when Method is set to Fixed:"
"Theta or Df."
msgstr "當方法設定為“固定”時，選擇脆弱性模型中要固定的引數：Theta或Df。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Theta"
msgstr "Theta"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value of Theta to fix in the frailty model. Only visible when Fix"
"is set to Theta."
msgstr "指定脆弱性模型中要固定的Theta值。僅當“固定”設定為Theta時可見。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Components"
msgstr "分量"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "統計"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model fit"
msgstr "模型擬合"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include overall model fit statistics in the output."
msgstr "在輸出中包含整體模型擬合統計量。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "檢驗"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Test all parameters of the H₁ model."
msgstr "檢驗H₁模型的所有引數。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Likelihood ratio"
msgstr "似然比"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include the Likelihood Ratio Test in the model summary."
msgstr "在模型摘要中包括似然比檢驗。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Wald"
msgstr "Wald"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the Wald Test in the model summary. Disabled when a Frailty variable"
"is specified."
msgstr "在模型摘要中包括Wald檢驗。當指定脆弱性變數時停用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Coefficients"
msgstr "係數"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Estimates"
msgstr "估計值"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Display the estimated coefficients in the model output."
msgstr "在模型輸出中顯示估計係數。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Vovk-Sellke maximum p-ratio"
msgstr "Vovk-Sellke最大p值比"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include the Vovk-Sellke maximum p-ratio for each coefficient."
msgstr "為每個係數包含Vovk-Sellke最大p值比。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Hazard ratio estimates"
msgstr "風險比估計"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include frailty"
msgstr "包含脆弱性"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Include the effect of frailty in hazard ratio estimates. Only available when a"
"Frailty variable is specified."
msgstr "在風險比估計中包含脆弱性的影響。僅當指定了脆弱性變數時可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Confidence intervals"
msgstr "置信區間"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Include confidence intervals for the coefficients."
msgstr "包含係數的置信區間。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Plot"
msgstr "圖表"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "診斷"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Proportional Hazards"
msgstr "比例風險"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Table"
msgstr "表格"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Provide a table to test the proportional hazards assumption."
msgstr "提供用於檢驗比例風險假設的表。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Generate plots to assess the proportional hazards assumption."
msgstr "生成用於評估比例風險假設的圖。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Transformation"
msgstr "變換"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the transformation for time in proportional hazards testing: KM, Rank,"
"or Identity."
msgstr "選擇比例風險檢驗中時間的變換：KM、秩或恆等。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "KM"
msgstr "KM"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Rank"
msgstr "秩"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "恆等"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Test terms"
msgstr "檢驗項"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residual Plots"
msgstr "殘差圖"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. time"
msgstr "殘差對時間"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus time to detect non-proportional hazards. Available only"
"for Martingale or Deviance residuals."
msgstr "繪製殘差對時間的圖以檢測非比例風險。僅適用於鞅或偏差殘差。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predictors"
msgstr "殘差對預測變數"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus predictors to assess model fit. Available when model"
"terms are specified."
msgstr "繪製殘差對預測變數的圖以評估模型擬合。當指定模型項時可用。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals vs. predicted survival"
msgstr "殘差對預測生存"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Plot residuals versus predicted survival probabilities. Available only for"
"Martingale or Deviance residuals."
msgstr "繪製殘差對預測生存機率的圖。僅適用於鞅或偏差殘差。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Residuals histogram"
msgstr "殘差直方圖"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display a histogram of residuals to assess their distribution. Available only"
"for Martingale or Deviance residuals."
msgstr "顯示殘差的直方圖以評估其分佈。僅適用於鞅或偏差殘差。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "型別"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the type of residuals to plot: Martingale, Deviance, Score, Schoenfeld,"
"or Scaled Schoenfeld."
msgstr "選擇要繪製的殘差型別：鞅、偏差、得分、Schoenfeld或縮放Schoenfeld。"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Martingale"
msgstr "鞅"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Deviance"
msgstr "偏差"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Score"
msgstr "得分"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Schoenfeld"
msgstr "Schoenfeld"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Scaled Schoenfeld"
msgstr "縮放Schoenfeld"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Plot"
msgstr "圖表"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "型別"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Select the type of statistic to plot: Survival, Risk, Cumulative Hazard, or"
"Complementary Log-Log."
msgstr "選擇要繪製的統計量型別：生存、風險、累積風險或互補對數對數。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Survival"
msgstr "生存"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Risk"
msgstr "風險"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Cumulative hazard"
msgstr "累積風險"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Complementary log-log"
msgstr "互補對數對數"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Confidence interval"
msgstr "置信區間"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Include confidence intervals in the survival plot to show the variability"
"around the estimates."
msgstr "在生存圖中包含置信區間，以顯示估計值周圍的變異性。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Risk table"
msgstr "風險表"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Add a risk table below the plot to display additional information about the"
"number of subjects at risk over time."
msgstr "在圖下方新增風險表，以顯示隨時間處於風險中的被試數量的附加資訊。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Number at risk"
msgstr "處於風險中的數量"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Display the number of subjects at risk at each time point in the risk table."
msgstr "在風險表中顯示每個時間點處於風險中的被試數量。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Cum. number of observed events"
msgstr "觀測事件的累積數量"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Cum. number of censored obs."
msgstr "刪失觀測的累積數量"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display the cumulative number of censored observations at each time point in"
"the risk table."
msgstr "在風險表中顯示每個時間點刪失觀測的累積數量。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Number of events in time interval"
msgstr "時間區間內的事件數"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display the number of events that occurred within each time interval in the"
"risk table."
msgstr "在風險表中顯示每個時間區間內發生的事件數。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Number of censored obs. in time interval"
msgstr "時間區間內的刪失觀測數"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Display the number of censored observations within each time interval in the"
"risk table."
msgstr "在風險表中顯示每個時間區間內的刪失觀測數。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "As a single line"
msgstr "作為單行"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Combine all selected risk table statistics into a single line for a more"
"compact display."
msgstr "將所有選定的風險表統計量合併為單行，以獲得更緊湊的顯示。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Add quantile"
msgstr "新增分位數"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Legend"
msgstr "圖例"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Choose the position of the legend on the plot: Bottom, Right, Left, Top, or"
"None. Only available when Strata variables are specified."
msgstr "選擇圖中圖例的位置：底部、右側、左側、頂部或無。僅當指定分層變數時可用。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "底部"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右側"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左側"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Top"
msgstr "頂部"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "無"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Customize the color palette used in the plot. Only available when Strata"
"variables are specified."
msgstr "自定義圖中使用的調色盤。僅當指定分層變數時可用。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主題"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid ""
"Select the theme for the plot's appearance: JASP for the default look or"
"ggsurvfit for the ggsurvfit package style."
msgstr "選擇圖外觀的主題：JASP為預設外觀，或ggsurvfit為ggsurvfit包樣式。"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "JASP"
msgstr "JASP"

msgctxt "SurvivalPlot|"
msgid "ggsurvfit"
msgstr "ggsurvfit"
